,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["_collect_node_ids at tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py:838-856 passes NO env to subprocess.run, so it inherits the full os.environ today.","test_ci_workflow_parity_basetemp.py:32 sets PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT via monkeypatch.setenv (mutating os.environ) and asserts it reaches the child at :37-38 — this works TODAY only because the collector inherits os.environ.","Plan Constraint: 'env is REQUIRED and forwarded VERBATIM — never merged onto os.environ' — so the converted collector cannot rely on inheritance and must pass an explicit env.","tests/_subprocess_env.py:37 shows subprocess_env(...) copies os.environ; _store_isolation.py:31 uses it, which is why that site's PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT survives — the collector has no equivalent today."],"finding":"The parity-collector conversion (test_ci_workflow_parity.py:839) must build an env derived from os.environ, or PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT will no longer reach the child under the REQUIRED-verbatim-env rule.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"feee844c75d48d071","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach / Constraints ('env is REQUIRED and forwarded VERBATIM — never merged onto os.environ') vs Acceptance Criteria ('PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT reaches the store-isolation child ... test_ci_workflow_parity_basetemp.py ... passing unchanged')","norm_id":"ne9845e88cb4448b5","priority":0.8889,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A conversion of the parity collector passes a minimal or empty-ish env (as the security sites do) and PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT is silently dropped, so the nested collect run cleans another run's shared numbered temp root and test_ci_workflow_parity_basetemp.py fails — contradicting the AC that it passes unchanged."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"In the Constraints/divergences note that the collector currently inherits os.environ and must be converted with env=subprocess_env() (or an os.environ-derived mapping) so PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT survives; contrast it with the four security sites whose minimal env is intentional.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"certification_cannot_prove","internal_conflict":"medium","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"block","decision_margin":0.2889,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Current `_collect_node_ids` (tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py:839-856) passes NO `env`, inheriting the full parent environment.","Pinning test tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity_basetemp.py:32-33 sets `monkeypatch.setenv('PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT', ...)` on the PARENT env and calls `_collect_node_ids` directly, relying on inheritance to reach the child.","Plan constraint: 'env is REQUIRED and forwarded VERBATIM — never merged onto os.environ' means the converted caller must build the env explicitly; a minimal mapping would drop the inherited PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT.","AC bullet 8 names test_ci_workflow_parity_basetemp.py as passing unchanged but ties PYTEST_DEBUG_TEMPROOT survival only to the store-isolation child, not the parity collector."],"fin